								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg7728#msg7728">Re:History of Rodcet Nife  [read and add to it]</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #45 on:</b> May 05, 2004, 02:48:42 pm &#187;</span></td>
