	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg7867"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=138" title="View the profile of Chroam">Chroam</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 15<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I'm a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=138"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg7867#msg7867"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg7867#msg7867">Re:History of Rodcet Nife  [read and add to it]</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #56 on:</b> May 10, 2004, 05:39:50 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Hegemony marks its founding as 19th of July, 2001. &nbsp;This was roughly a week after Forsaken formed (both had significant populations of former Highland Clan members).<br /><br />A year later (08/01/02), we raided ToV (HoT) for the first time<br />A year later (07/*/03), we were killing our first real PoP mobs (e.g. 07/10/03 Terris Thule, 07/28/03 Aerin Dar).<br /><br /><br />later,<br />Chroam<br />of Hegemony
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg7871"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=244" title="View the profile of Taylen Arenson">Taylen Arenson</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 22<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								...<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=244"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg7871#msg7871"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg7871#msg7871">Re:History of Rodcet Nife  [read and add to it]</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #57 on:</b> May 10, 2004, 07:28:07 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I know for a fact that Circle of Sol (Aktar/Fargus&#039;s guild) was formed well before Kunark came out (since I was a member). &nbsp;I believe they absorbed another guild (Greycloaks?) and went along for a bit until the upper tier left to form Mythmakers. (I left to join Legion of Feir Dal). &nbsp;CoS didn&#039;t do any high end raids after that I think.<br /><br />Mythmakers stumbled along for a while until Fargus bailed on that and made Axiom Shift. &nbsp;Legion of Feir Dal joined with Hawkwood&#039;s Company to make Hawkwood&#039;s Legion. &nbsp;Hawkwood&#039;s Legion then joined up with Corwil/Galis led DragonFlyers (I think) to make Cascade Point. &nbsp; <br /><br />The upper tier CP players got frustrated in a casual guild of near 300 people and left to form Reign of Swords (May 2002) with some going to EiE (like Helo said). &nbsp;Reign of Swords allied themselves with Axiom Shift. &nbsp;This couldn&#039;t be worked out and they went their separate ways.<br /><br />Axiom Shift stayed fairly small until it imploded with the upper eschelons going to Ascent/EiE/DA and a fair number going to Reign of Swords.<br /><br />Sorry I don&#039;t have any real dates... but honestly it&#039;s just a big ol&#039; 5 year blur to me.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: May 10, 2004, 07:43:53 pm by Taylen Arenson</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Tay<br />Forest Stalker<br />Reign of Swords
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg7873"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=612" title="View the profile of Aktar">Aktar</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 2<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								An Everquest Player on Rodcet Nife<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=612"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg7873#msg7873"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg7873#msg7873">Re:History of Rodcet Nife  [read and add to it]</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #58 on:</b> May 10, 2004, 08:24:38 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							CoS was formed in August of 99 (was that the August after the server formed?) and I &quot;retired&quot; probably a month or so after Kunark came out-- at which point CoS did the &quot;what do we do now?&quot; thing... and then raiders split off to form Mythmakers and the casual people stayed in CoS (which is still around to this day, incidentally).<br /><br />Feelings were somewhat hurt (as they always are) during that time-- and Fargus never joined Mythmakers. &nbsp;CoS and Mythmakers did raid together since everyone was still friends-- and it was during that time that I came back for the Sky raid (think that was late August after Kunark-- so... 00?) and started playing again.<br /><br />Fargus and I couldn&#039;t stand some idiots that Mythmakers had wound up inviting (Rogosh being the primary one-- god that guy was a terrible player), so although they&#039;d formed the guild with my last name... we decided to form Axiom Shift and leave the others behind. &nbsp;Which of course created more bad blood between some people. &nbsp;Some people retired (Nepenthe) and some people moved to other raiding guilds at the time (Talias, Deirdre).<br /><br />Axiom Shift was never a good guild to co-exist with other guilds because none of the leader-types wanted to do a DKP system. &nbsp;It went against some kind of mentality we&#039;d all established in the formation of the guild... that was probably a bit of its downfall as a higher-tier raiding guild.<br /><br />We failed to do the alliance thing well with Dragon Knight, AoD and RoS... ultimately all for very similar reasons: &nbsp;equitable distribution of loot. &nbsp;Could go round and round the horn on that one-- but this is just a history lesson.<br /><br />That&#039;s history as I remember of the guilds I was in.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
