							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />-- Duke Mallagin the Champion of War<br /><br /><br />[17:55] &lt;Krowbar&gt; build a thousand bridges and suck one dick and people call you a cocksucker, not bridge builder <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" />
